addon.innerscape — ResonantOS add-on
Copyright 2026 Kyanite Labs

This add-on wraps Innerscape's local agent surface and vendors its CLI module
under vendor/:

  * vendor/innerscape/ — byte-identical extractions of the COMMITTED HEAD of
    Innerscape 0.1.0 (https://github.com/KyaniteLabs/Innerscape), licensed
    MIT. The full upstream license text, including its copyright attribution,
    is in vendor/innerscape/LICENSE. Regenerate and re-pin with
    scripts/vendor-innerscape.mjs; VENDOR-MANIFEST.json holds a SHA-256 pin
    for every vendored file and records which upstream working-tree edits
    were deliberately NOT vendored.

Vendored files: tools/innerscape-cli.mjs (the agent CLI module: projectBrief,
moduleMap, planningPrompt), tools/innerscape-mcp.mjs (the upstream stdio MCP
server — vendored for completeness; this service does NOT run it, it imports
the CLI functions in-process), package.json (provenance), LICENSE.

The exposed surface is three pure, stateless functions. Innerscape's
data-bearing surfaces — the Fastify/Prisma/PostgreSQL backend, the Expo
mobile app, any journaling or emotional-check-in storage — are not vendored
and are unreachable through this service by construction. The service
persists nothing and requests zero capabilities.
